        "r": 520.8200000000004,
        "b": 696.7
      },
      "content": "With the door in the partially closed position, slightly raise the left end (callout 1; raise it over the sheet-metal hinge boss), and then slide the door to the left (callout 2) to release the right hinge (callout 3)."
    },
